WEBVTT

NOTE
This file was generated by Descript <www.descript.com>

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:03.860
Rhiannon: A mental health crisis
is an emergency that poses a

00:00:03.860 --> 00:00:07.680
direct and immediate threat to
physical or emotional wellbeing.

00:00:08.210 --> 00:00:12.380
There is no one set definition of
what a crisis entails, as it is

00:00:12.380 --> 00:00:14.329
highly personal to each individual.

00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:18.110
Leah: A mental health crisis in children
and young people, is usually when

00:00:18.110 --> 00:00:21.650
they show signs of being extremely
anxious, having panic attacks,

00:00:21.759 --> 00:00:23.700
feeling suicidal or self-harming.

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:28.849
They may also show signs of feeling very
high, or having a very low mood, or even

00:00:28.849 --> 00:00:30.790
suffering from episodes of psychosis.

00:00:31.840 --> 00:00:35.360
Rhiannon: They may be facing extreme
challenges in their life, such as

00:00:35.360 --> 00:00:39.449
bereavement, financial problems
within the family, family break-up,

00:00:39.570 --> 00:00:41.820
exam stress or housing problems.

00:00:42.160 --> 00:00:45.150
They may also already have
a mental health diagnosis.

00:00:45.570 --> 00:00:49.709
Or they may have challenges that
are not obvious, which may just be

00:00:49.710 --> 00:00:51.199
affecting their mental well-being.

00:00:51.830 --> 00:00:55.850
Leah: How do you plan for something like
a mental health crisis, especially if

00:00:55.850 --> 00:01:00.010
you hope it won’t happen or have no idea
about the possibility it might happen?

00:01:01.010 --> 00:01:05.959
As in any health crisis the first place
to go is Accident & Emergency [999] by

00:01:05.969 --> 00:01:09.149
phone or directly at the local hospital.

00:01:09.770 --> 00:01:14.559
Also, emergency GP appointments are
available, even if not registered

00:01:14.570 --> 00:01:17.810
and if talking is needed, there
are multiple helplines available.

00:01:18.760 --> 00:01:22.970
Rhiannon: There is always an option and an
answer, so make sure to stay aware of what

00:01:22.980 --> 00:01:24.800
these are and how to make use of them.

